---
// TODO(owner): have this reviewed by a lawyer before selling any lead or running ads. It is a starting template, not legal advice.
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { SITE_NAME, EMAIL } from '../site.config.mjs';
---
<Page title="Privacy Policy" description={`What data ${SITE_NAME} collects, how it is used, and your choices.`} updated="November 27, 2026">
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Quote requests.</strong> If you use our <a href="/find-an-installer/">find an installer</a> form, we collect what you enter (name, email, phone, ZIP code, project details), the consent statement you agreed to, and technical records of the submission (date and time, IP address, browser type and the page you submitted from). We keep these records to show what you agreed to.</li>
    <li><strong>Analytics.</strong> We may use web analytics to understand which pages are read. This collects usage data such as pages viewed, device type and approximate location.</li>
    <li><strong>Affiliate cookies.</strong> When you click a link to a retailer, the retailer or its affiliate network may set a cookie to credit us for a sale. Those cookies are governed by the retailer's privacy policy.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>How we use and share quote requests</h2>
  <p>We use your request to match you with a licensed installer serving your area. With your consent, we share it with one installer or referral partner, who may contact you about your project, and we may be paid for that referral. Under some state privacy laws, such as California's, sharing personal information for payment can count as a "sale". We do not share quote requests with anyone else except as required by law.</p>
  <p>We keep quote request records for up to four years, then delete them, unless you ask us to delete them sooner.</p>
  <h2 id="do-not-sell">Do not sell or share my personal information</h2>
  <p>You can tell us not to sell or share your information at any time. Email <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}?subject=Do%20not%20sell`}>{EMAIL}</a> with the subject "Do not sell" and the email or phone number you used. We will stop sharing it and confirm within 15 business days. You can also ask what we hold about you, or ask us to delete it, the same way.</p>
  <h2>Calls and texts</h2>
  <p>If you agreed to be contacted, you can withdraw that consent at any time by replying STOP to a text, telling the caller, or emailing us. We do not need your consent to sell you anything.</p>
  <h2>What we do not do</h2>
  <p>We do not ask for payment details. All purchases happen on the retailer's or installer's side.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Privacy questions: <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a>.</p>
</Page>
